{"3429190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pawsta - A Cozy Claymation Cooking Game", "steam_appid": 3429190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Support Pawsta 🐭 on Kickstarter! 💚</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/d6700a6e399498a7be7db3bbcec48d94.poster.avif?t=1783768392\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/d6700a6e399498a7be7db3bbcec48d94.webm?t=1783768392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/d6700a6e399498a7be7db3bbcec48d94.mp4?t=1783768392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Pawsta</strong> 🐭 is mostly being cooked up by a <strong>small team</strong> of cozy chefs, who he wants to bring on to <strong>help</strong> out more! 👩‍🍳 <br> <br>To help <strong>achieve</strong> this, we've decided to run a <strong>Kickstarter</strong> <strong>campaign</strong> :)) Please consider checking it out &amp; pressing the  <strong>notify</strong> <strong>button</strong> to <strong>hear</strong> when it <strong>launches</strong>! ✨ <br> <br>Thank you, lovely person reading this! 💖</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Pawsta</i></strong><i> is a <strong>cozy</strong> cooking game with cute <strong>claymation</strong>-style graphics. It stars <strong>Rigatoni</strong>, the mouse🐭, as he travels the world <strong>mastering</strong> cuisines &amp; collecting <strong>mice-alin stars</strong>! </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Make your <strong>Nonna </strong>proud by helping out your <strong>relatives </strong>at their <strong>international </strong>restaurants</i> ✨ </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cook from Scratch!🍅</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn </strong>to cook new cuisines<strong> from scratch</strong> by building them up <strong>step-by-step</strong>. <strong>Chop</strong> veggies, <strong>roll</strong> out dough, and <strong>sprinkle</strong> in fresh herbs until the food is<strong> just right</strong>! 🤌</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/1003de33ca7e7eecfc4f3a369ab04a40.poster.avif?t=1783768392\" aria-label=\"Pawsta dough gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/1003de33ca7e7eecfc4f3a369ab04a40.webm?t=1783768392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/1003de33ca7e7eecfc4f3a369ab04a40.mp4?t=1783768392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve Cute Animal Guests!😸</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders from a <strong>cute roster </strong>of <strong>animal </strong>patrons. Try to follow their orders as best as you can by choosing the correct food ingredients. Lots of <strong>happy customers </strong>can lead to great things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a8bfd46ddf61595918aa2a4098aa540a.poster.avif?t=1783768392\" aria-label=\"Pawsta kitty order gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a8bfd46ddf61595918aa2a4098aa540a.webm?t=1783768392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a8bfd46ddf61595918aa2a4098aa540a.mp4?t=1783768392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fly Around the World!🛩️</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rigatoni has family all around the <strong>globe</strong>! Team up with your <strong>pilot</strong> friend, <strong>Balto, </strong>to travel the <strong>world </strong>and help out at their restaurants. It's <strong>your call </strong>where to go next, be it <strong>Brazil </strong>or <strong>Japan</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a35ce53894baaecb0e021203acfe9239.poster.avif?t=1783768392\" aria-label=\"Pawsta plane flying gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a35ce53894baaecb0e021203acfe9239.webm?t=1783768392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a35ce53894baaecb0e021203acfe9239.mp4?t=1783768392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master new cuisines! 🍣</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong> and <strong>master</strong> new <strong>cuisines</strong> from the <strong>countries</strong> you visit, including <strong>sushi</strong> in Japan! <strong>Impress</strong> enough guests &amp; you'll also gain access to special <strong>mice-alin</strong> dishes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/f071b79b8225a7a7908a6811189a16da.poster.avif?t=1783768392\" aria-label=\"Pawsta sushi cutting gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/f071b79b8225a7a7908a6811189a16da.webm?t=1783768392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst